# Behaviour-analysis test footage. These are real facial images of a living
# person — biometric personal data under the PDPA. Committing them would
# contradict the project's own CR-09 position that only derived events are
# retained. Only the aggregate results under docs/evidence/ are versioned.
clips/
clips_*/

